SUMMARY:Quantum Group Meeting: "Local Autonomous Inference Machines For Qua
 ntum Error Correcting Codes" - Sid Midha (Gopalakrishnan Group)
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Title: Local autonomous inference machines for quantum error co
 rrecting codesAbstract: Quantum error correction is the central ingredient
  in making large-scale quantum computers work. Over the last three decades
 \, we have found increasingly powerful ways of redundantly encoding quantu
 m information so that it can survive physical errors. Yet\, a central chal
 lenge remains decoding:&nbsp\;the task of inferring which errors have occu
 rred from syndrome measurements\, and determining how they should be corre
 cted. As quantum processors grow in size\,
CATEGORIES:Quantum Group Meeting
