SUMMARY:Quantum Group Meeting: Quantum signatures in molecular polaritonics
  and other emerging photonic platforms. - Arghadip Koner (Scholes Group)
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Title: Quantum signatures in molecular polaritonics and other e
 merging photonic platforms.&nbsp\;Abstract: Molecular polaritons emerge wh
 en ensembles of molecules strongly couple to confined electromagnetic mode
 s\, enabling repeated energy exchange between light and matter. Such inter
 actions are expected to activate nonlinear optical processes\, yet many ex
 perimental observations remain accurately described by classical optics. W
 e address this paradox from a spectroscopic perspective. We derive a gener
 al expression for the polaritonic linear response\,
CATEGORIES:Quantum Group Meeting
